{"title": "Quant Super Practice — Mock #153", "duration_min": 20.0, "questions": [{"q_en": "<p>Amount of Rs.10000 invested at a rate of 10% compounded annually for 3 years will amount to:</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2352;&#2369;.10000 &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; 10% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352;, &#2357;&#2361; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; _____ &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs.12210", "Rs.13310", "Rs.14410", "Rs.15510"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;.12210", "&#2352;&#2369;.13310", "&#2352;&#2369;.14410", "&#2352;&#2369;.15510"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><img width=157 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20864/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=268 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20864/image012.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p><img width=157 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20864/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=268 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20864/image012.png\"></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum increased by 20% at some rate of simple interest in T years. The compound interest on Rs.12000 at same rate of interest in 3 years is Rs. 3972 when compounded annually. What should come in place of T?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; T &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; 20% &#2325;&#2368; &#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 12000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; 3972 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; T &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2310;&#2344;&#2366; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;?</p>", "options_en": ["4 years", "3 years", "1 year", "2 years"], "options_hi": ["4 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "1 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;", "2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Let, the rate of interest be R%.</p><p>Then, CI = 12000  X  ((1+R/100)<sup>3 </sup> - 1) = 3972</p><p>(1+R/100)<sup>3</sup> = (3972+12000)/12000</p><p>(100+R)<sup>3</sup> = 1331000</p><p>R = 10%</p><p>Now, at simple rate of interest,</p><p>20% of sum = sum X  10 X  T/100</p><p>T = 2 years</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let, the rate of interest be R%.</p><p>Then, CI = 12000  X  ((1+R/100)<sup>3 </sup> - 1) = 3972</p><p>(1+R/100)<sup>3</sup> = (3972+12000)/12000</p><p>(100+R)<sup>3</sup> = 1331000</p><p>R = 10%</p><p>Now, at simple rate of interest,</p><p>20% of sum = sum X  10 X  T/100</p><p>T = 2 years</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A certain sum amounts to &#8377;32210.2 in 15 months at the rate of 40% per annum compounded quarterly. Find the value of sum.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 40% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2376;&#2350;&#2366;&#2360;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; 15 &#2350;&#2361;&#2368;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#8377;32210.2 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["&#8377;24000", "&#8377;13600", "&#8377;20000", "&#8377;25200"], "options_hi": ["&#8377;24000", "&#8377;13600", "&#8377;20000", "&#8377;25200"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>A = &#8377;32210.2, n = 15/3 = 5, R = 40/4 = 10%</p><p>32210.2 = P * (1 + 10/100)<sup>5</sup></p><p>32210.2 = P * (11/10)<sup>5</sup></p><p>P = 0.2 * 100000</p><p>P = &#8377;20000</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>A = &#8377;32210.2, n = 15/3 = 5, R = 40/4 = 10%</p><p>32210.2 = P * (1 + 10/100)<sup>5</sup></p><p>32210.2 = P * (11/10)<sup>5</sup></p><p>P = 0.2 * 100000</p><p>P = &#8377;20000</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A person invested a certain amount in compound interest at a 25% rate of interest compounded annually for three years. If the compound interest received is Rs. 4880, then find the amount invested. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2375; 25% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; 4880 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 5120", "Rs. 5520", "Rs. 5820", "Rs. 5420"], "options_hi": ["5120 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "5520 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "5820 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "5420 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>25% = 1/4 </p><p>C.I = P * (5<sup>T</sup>  -  4<sup>T</sup>)/4<sup>T</sup> [5 = sum of numerator and denominator of 1/4 and T = Time]</p><p>4880 = P * (5<sup>3</sup>  -  4<sup>3</sup>)/4<sup>3</sup> </p><p>4880 * 64 = P * 61 </p><p>P = 4880 * 64/61 </p><p>P = Rs. 5120 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>25% = 1/4 </p><p>C.I = P * (5<sup>T</sup>  -  4<sup>T</sup>)/4<sup>T</sup> [5 = sum of numerator and denominator of 1/4 and T = Time]</p><p>4880 = P * (5<sup>3</sup>  -  4<sup>3</sup>)/4<sup>3</sup> </p><p>4880 * 64 = P * 61 </p><p>P = 4880 * 64/61 </p><p>P = Rs. 5120 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A certain sum of money at 15% per annum compounded annually for two years has amounted to Rs. 4232. If the same sum of money is invested into simple interest at 22% per annum for four years, then what is the simple interest?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 15% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2325;&#2352; &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2369;. 4232 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; 22% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 2832", "Rs. 2772", "Rs. 2816", "Rs. 3232"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 2832", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2772", "&#2352;&#2369;. 2816", "&#2352;&#2369;. 3232"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let Rs. P be the interest</p><p>4232 = P(1 + 15/100)<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; P = 4232 * 100/115 * 100/115</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs. 3200</p><p>And SI = (3200 * 22 * 4)/100 = Rs. 2816</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let Rs. P be the interest</p><p>4232 = P(1 + 15/100)<sup>2</sup></p><p>=&gt; P = 4232 * 100/115 * 100/115</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs. 3200</p><p>And SI = (3200 * 22 * 4)/100 = Rs. 2816</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If a person invested Rs. 3200 in compound interest at a 30% rate of interest compounded annually for three years, then find the total amount received. </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2375; &#2352;&#2369;.3200 &#2325;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2379; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; 30% &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2340;&#2368;&#2344; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2350;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2352;&#2343;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 7630.4", "Rs. 7830.4", "Rs. 7230.4", "Rs. 7030.4"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 7630.4", "&#2352;&#2369;. 7830.4", "&#2352;&#2369;. 7230.4", "&#2352;&#2369;. 7030.4"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Amount = C.I + Principal amount </p><p>30% = 3/10 </p><p>C.I = P (13<sup>T</sup>  -  10<sup>T</sup>)10<sup>T</sup> [13 = sum of numerator and denominator of 3/10 and T = Time]</p><p>= 3200 * (13<sup>3</sup>  -  10<sup>3</sup>)/10<sup>3</sup> </p><p>= 3200 * (2197  -  1000)/1000 </p><p>= Rs. 3830.4 </p><p>Amount = 3830.4 + 3200 = Rs. 7030.4</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Amount = C.I + Principal amount </p><p>30% = 3/10 </p><p>C.I = P (13<sup>T</sup>  -  10<sup>T</sup>)10<sup>T</sup> [13 = sum of numerator and denominator of 3/10 and T = Time]</p><p>= 3200 * (13<sup>3</sup>  -  10<sup>3</sup>)/10<sup>3</sup> </p><p>= 3200 * (2197  -  1000)/1000 </p><p>= Rs. 3830.4 </p><p>Amount = 3830.4 + 3200 = Rs. 7030.4</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If a person invested Rs. 6000 in compound interest at a 20% rate of interest compounded half yearly for two years, then find the compound interest received.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325;&#2381;&#2340;&#2367; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; 20% &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 6000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 2484.6", "Rs. 2784.6", "Rs. 2684.6", "Rs. 2984.6"], "options_hi": ["2484.6 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "2784.6 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "2684.6 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "2984.6 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p><b>[For half yearly - Time double and the Rate of interest half]</b></p><p>20%/2 = 1/10 and Time = 2 * 2 = 4 </p><p>C.I = P (11<sup>T</sup>  -  10<sup>T</sup>)/10<sup>T</sup> [11 = sum of numerator and denominator of 1/10 and T = Time]</p><p>= 6000 * (11<sup>4</sup>  -  10<sup>4</sup>)/10<sup>4</sup> </p><p>= 6000 * (14641  -  10000)/10000 </p><p>= 6 * 4641/10</p><p>= Rs. 2784.6 </p>", "solution_hi": "<p><b>[For half yearly - Time double and the Rate of interest half]</b></p><p>20%/2 = 1/10 and Time = 2 * 2 = 4 </p><p>C.I = P (11<sup>T</sup>  -  10<sup>T</sup>)/10<sup>T</sup> [11 = sum of numerator and denominator of 1/10 and T = Time]</p><p>= 6000 * (11<sup>4</sup>  -  10<sup>4</sup>)/10<sup>4</sup> </p><p>= 6000 * (14641  -  10000)/10000 </p><p>= 6 * 4641/10</p><p>= Rs. 2784.6 </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Astha borrowed a sum of Rs. 12800 at 6.25% per annum compounded annually for two years, then what is the total interest paid by Astha at the end of two years?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2310;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366; &#2344;&#2375; &#2352;&#2369;. 12800 &#2325;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344; &#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2344;&#2375; &#2357;&#2366;&#2354;&#2368; 6.25% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2368;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2310;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2349;&#2369;&#2327;&#2340;&#2366;&#2344; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2369;&#2354; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 1760", "Rs. 1430", "Rs. 1650", "Rs. 1890"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;. 1760", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1430", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1650", "&#2352;&#2369;. 1890"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>CI = 12800[(1 + 6.25/100)<sup>2</sup>  -  1]</p><p>=&gt; CI =12800 * 33/256</p><p>=&gt; CI = Rs. 1650</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>CI = 12800[(1 + 6.25/100)<sup>2</sup>  -  1]</p><p>=&gt; CI =12800 * 33/256</p><p>=&gt; CI = Rs. 1650</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>P borrowed certain amount from bank at 20% SI for 2 years. At the same time, he lent the same amount to Q at same annual rate of compound interest for 2 years. In the process, P earns &#8377;1000, then find the borrowed amount by P.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>P &#2344;&#2375; &#2348;&#2376;&#2306;&#2325; &#2360;&#2375; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 20% &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2325;&#2369;&#2331; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2368;&#2404; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2350;&#2351; &#2346;&#2352; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; Q &#2325;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368;&#2404; &#2311;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, P &#8377;1000 &#2325;&#2350;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; P &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2354;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["&#8377;30000", "&#8377;20000", "&#8377;25000", "&#8377;15000"], "options_hi": ["&#8377;30000", "&#8377;20000", "&#8377;25000", "&#8377;15000"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let borrowed amount = 'x'</p><p>Interest amount given by P to bank = (x * 20 * 2)/100 = 0.4x</p><p>Interest amount received by P from Q = x * [1.2<sup>2</sup>  -  1] = 0.44x</p><p>According to the question:</p><p>0.44x  -  0.4x = 1000</p><p>x = 25000</p><p>Hence, borrowed amount by P = &#8377;25000</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let borrowed amount = 'x'</p><p>Interest amount given by P to bank = (x * 20 * 2)/100 = 0.4x</p><p>Interest amount received by P from Q = x * [1.2<sup>2</sup>  -  1] = 0.44x</p><p>According to the question:</p><p>0.44x  -  0.4x = 1000</p><p>x = 25000</p><p>Hence, borrowed amount by P = &#8377;25000</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>An amount of &#8377;7650 is invested for 3 years by Anil. For the first 2 years, the rate of simple interest is 16% while for the last one year, he invested the amount at compound interest and the rate of compound interest is 20% compounded annually. How much amount received after 3 years?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2309;&#2344;&#2367;&#2354; &#2344;&#2375; &#8377;7650 &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2404; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; 16% &#2361;&#2376;, &#2332;&#2348;&#2325;&#2367; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2367;&#2350; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2360;&#2344;&#2375; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2325;&#2375; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2366; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; 20% &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2313;&#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2361;&#2369;&#2312;?</p>", "options_en": ["&#8377;12117.6", "&#8377;10028.8", "&#8377;11922.4", "&#8377;10383.5"], "options_hi": ["&#8377;12117.6", "&#8377;10028.8", "&#8377;11922.4", "&#8377;10383.5"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Amount received after 2 years at simple interest = 7650 + (7650*16*2/100) = &#8377;10098</p><p>Now,</p><p>Amount received after 1 year at compound interest = 10098*(1 + 20/100) = &#8377;12117.6</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Amount received after 2 years at simple interest = 7650 + (7650*16*2/100) = &#8377;10098</p><p>Now,</p><p>Amount received after 1 year at compound interest = 10098*(1 + 20/100) = &#8377;12117.6</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The difference between simple interest and compound interest after 2 years is Rs. 42 at 10% rate of interest. Find the principal amount.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>10% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2324;&#2352; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; 42 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2343;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 4200", "Rs. 4250", "Rs. 4400", "Rs. 4550"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369; 4200", "&#2352;&#2369; 4250", "&#2352;&#2369; 4400", "&#2352;&#2369; 4550"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Difference = P(r)<sup>2</sup>/(100)<sup>2</sup></p><p>42 = (P * 10 * 10)/(100 * 100)</p><p>P = Rs. 4200</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Difference = P(r)<sup>2</sup>/(100)<sup>2</sup></p><p>42 = (P * 10 * 10)/(100 * 100)</p><p>P = Rs. 4200</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>The difference between compound interest and simple interest on a certain sum of money for 3 years at 10% p.a. is Rs. 1178. Find the principal.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2352; 10% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2368; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; 3 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2352;&#2369;.1178 &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2343;&#2344; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs.38000", "Rs.36000", "Rs.35000", "Rs.40000"], "options_hi": ["&#2352;&#2369;.38000", "&#2352;&#2369;.36000", "&#2352;&#2369;.35000", "&#2352;&#2369;.40000"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>Let the principal be P.</p><p>S.I. for 3 years = 10% &times; 3P = 0.3P</p><p>C.I. for 3 years = P [(1.1)<sup>3</sup>-1]</p><p>0.331P &ndash; 0.3P = 1178</p><p>P = Rs.38000</p><p>Hence, option a.</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the principal be P.</p><p>S.I. for 3 years = 10% &times; 3P = 0.3P</p><p>C.I. for 3 years = P [(1.1)<sup>3</sup>-1]</p><p>0.331P &ndash; 0.3P = 1178</p><p>P = Rs.38000</p><p>Hence, option a.</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Amount of Rs.40000 will amount to Rs.44944 in 2 years at what rate of interest compounded annually? </p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2352;&#2369;. 40000 &#2325;&#2368; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2360; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2325;&#2352; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2352;&#2369;. 44944 &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2319;&#2327;&#2368;?</p>", "options_en": ["4%", "6%", "5%", "3%"], "options_hi": ["4%", "6%", "5%", "3%"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>For compound interest:</p><p><img width=153 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20894/image010.png\"> </p><p><img width=175 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20894/image011.png\"> </p><p><img width=252 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20894/image012.png\"> </p>", "solution_hi": "<p>For compound interest:</p><p><img width=153 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20894/image010.png\"> </p><p><img width=175 height=45 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20894/image011.png\"> </p><p><img width=252 height=20 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p20894/image012.png\"> </p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum of Rs.15000 is invested at 20% annual compound interest for 't' years and interest amount received is Rs.10920, then find the value of 't'.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>15000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 't' &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; 20% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2324;&#2352; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 10920 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; 't' &#2325;&#2366; &#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2381;&#2351; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["1", "2", "3", "4"], "options_hi": ["1", "2", "3", "4"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Amount = 15000 + 10920 = Rs.25920</p><p>Now,</p><p>Amount: Principal</p><p>= 25920: 15000</p><p>= 216: 125</p><p>= 6<sup>3</sup>: 5<sup>3</sup></p><p>Rate of interest = 20% = 5: 6</p><p>Therefore, time (t) = 3 years</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Amount = 15000 + 10920 = Rs.25920</p><p>Now,</p><p>Amount: Principal</p><p>= 25920: 15000</p><p>= 216: 125</p><p>= 6<sup>3</sup>: 5<sup>3</sup></p><p>Rate of interest = 20% = 5: 6</p><p>Therefore, time (t) = 3 years</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Dhanush invested Rs. 25,000 at interest 12% per annum for one year. If the interest is compounded half-yearly. Find the amount will Dhanush get at the end of the year?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2343;&#2344;&#2369;&#2359; &#2344;&#2375; 25,000 &#2352;&#2369; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; 12% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2344;&#2367;&#2357;&#2375;&#2358; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;| &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2309;&#2352;&#2381;&#2343;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2340;&#2380;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;| &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2343;&#2344;&#2369;&#2359; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 29260", "Rs. 26250", "Rs. 26530", "Rs. 28090"], "options_hi": ["29260 &#2352;&#2369;", "26250 &#2352;&#2369;", "26530 &#2352;&#2369;", "28090 &#2352;&#2369;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>Interest is compounded half-yearly.</p><p>Hence rate of interest = 12/2</p><p>= 6% = 6/100 = 3/50</p><p>No. of periods = 2</p><p>Now,</p><p>Principal: Amount</p><p>50 * 50: 53 * 53</p><p>2500: 2809</p><p>Given,</p><p>2500 units = Rs.25000</p><p>2809 units = 25000 x 2809/2500</p><p>= Rs.28090</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Interest is compounded half-yearly.</p><p>Hence rate of interest = 12/2</p><p>= 6% = 6/100 = 3/50</p><p>No. of periods = 2</p><p>Now,</p><p>Principal: Amount</p><p>50 * 50: 53 * 53</p><p>2500: 2809</p><p>Given,</p><p>2500 units = Rs.25000</p><p>2809 units = 25000 x 2809/2500</p><p>= Rs.28090</p><p></p><p></p><p></p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Rohan lent a certain sum of money for two years. If he charged compound interest at rate of 14% and 8% in the first year and the second year respectively and he received Rs. 73872 after two years, then what is the sum of money he lent?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2352;&#2379;&#2361;&#2344; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2375;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;| &#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2357;&#2361; &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2375; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2324;&#2352; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350;&#2358;&#2307; 14% &#2324;&#2352; 8% &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2357;&#2360;&#2370;&#2354;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2357;&#2361; &#2342;&#2379; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; 73872 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, &#2340;&#2379; &#2313;&#2360;&#2325;&#2375; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368; &#2327;&#2312; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 75000", "Rs. 70000", "Rs. 60000", "Rs. 85000"], "options_hi": ["75000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "70000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "60000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "85000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>Let the sum of money be Rs. P</p><p>According to the question,</p><p>73872 = P * (1 + 14/100) * (1 + 8/100)</p><p>=&gt; 73872 = P * 114/100 * 108/100</p><p>=&gt; P = 73872 * 100 * 100/(108 * 114)</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs. 60000</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Let the sum of money be Rs. P</p><p>According to the question,</p><p>73872 = P * (1 + 14/100) * (1 + 8/100)</p><p>=&gt; 73872 = P * 114/100 * 108/100</p><p>=&gt; P = 73872 * 100 * 100/(108 * 114)</p><p>=&gt; P = Rs. 60000</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If an amount of Rs.2500 is lent at a rate of 10% compounded annually, what will be the interest for the fourth year?</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; 2500 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2319; &#2325;&#2368; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 10% &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2340;&#2379; &#2330;&#2380;&#2341;&#2375; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2379;&#2327;&#2366;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 240.50", "Rs. 302.50", "Rs. 332.75", "Rs. 366.25"], "options_hi": ["240.50 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2319;", "302.50 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2319;", "332.75 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2319;", "366.25 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2319;"], "answer": 2, "solution_en": "<p>The interest for the fourth year = (final amount after 4 years) - (final amount after 3 years) .</p><p>Required interest = 2500(11/10)<sup>4 </sup> -  2500(11/10)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 2500 x (1.4641  -  1.331) = 2500 x 0.1331 = Rs 332.75</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>The interest for the fourth year = (final amount after 4 years) - (final amount after 3 years) .</p><p>Required interest = 2500(11/10)<sup>4 </sup> -  2500(11/10)<sup>3</sup></p><p>= 2500 x (1.4641  -  1.331) = 2500 x 0.1331 = Rs 332.75</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>If the interest is compounded Bi-annually, find the compound interest on Rs 2000 for 4 years at 10% per annum.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2351;&#2342;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367; -&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2340;&#2380;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, 2000 &#2352;&#2369; &#2346;&#2352; 10% &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2342;&#2352; &#2360;&#2375; &#2330;&#2366;&#2352; &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2367;&#2340;&#2344;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</p>", "options_en": ["Rs 800", "Rs 1440", "Rs 2800", "Rs 880"], "options_hi": ["800 &#2352;&#2369;", "1440 &#2352;&#2369;", "2800 &#2352;&#2369;", "880 &#2352;&#2369;"], "answer": 3, "solution_en": "<p>if the interest is compounded Bi-annually, time = 4/2=2</p> <p>rate of interest= 10*2=20</p> <p>CI = 2000[(1+(20/100))<sup>2</sup> - 1]</p> <p>CI= 2000[36/25 -1]</p> <p>CI= 2000*11/25 = Rs 880</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>if the interest is compounded Bi-annually, time = 4/2=2</p> <p>rate of interest= 10*2=20</p> <p>CI = 2000[(1+(20/100))<sup>2</sup> - 1]</p> <p>CI= 2000[36/25 -1]</p> <p>CI= 2000*11/25 = Rs 880</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>Find the difference between compound interest and simple interest obtained on Rs. 30,000 at 15% rate of interest after 2 years.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>30,000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2346;&#2352; 15% &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2342;&#2352; &#2346;&#2352; 2 &#2357;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2366;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2324;&#2352; &#2360;&#2366;&#2343;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352; &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs. 625", "Rs. 675", "Rs. 825", "Rs. 922"], "options_hi": ["625 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "675 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "825 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "922 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 1, "solution_en": "<p>Difference = P(r/100)<sup>2</sup> </p><p>=&gt; 30,000(15/100)<sup>2</sup> = (30000 * 15 * 15)/(100 * 100)</p><p>=&gt; Rs. 675</p>", "solution_hi": "<p>Difference = P(r/100)<sup>2</sup> </p><p>=&gt; 30,000(15/100)<sup>2</sup> = (30000 * 15 * 15)/(100 * 100)</p><p>=&gt; Rs. 675</p>", "marks": 1.0, "neg": 0.25}, {"q_en": "<p>A sum amounts to Rs.14000 after 7 years and to Rs.20000 after 14 years at a certain compound interest compounded annually. Find the sum.</p>", "q_hi": "<p>&#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2330;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2357;&#2371;&#2342;&#2381;&#2343;&#2367; &#2348;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2332; &#2346;&#2352; &#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2359;&#2367;&#2325; &#2352;&#2370;&#2346; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379;&#2325;&#2352; &#2319;&#2325; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; 7 &#2360;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; 14000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2324;&#2352; 14 &#2360;&#2366;&#2354; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2366;&#2342; 20000 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2343;&#2344;&#2352;&#2366;&#2358;&#2367; (&#2350;&#2370;&#2354;&#2343;&#2344;) &#2332;&#2381;&#2334;&#2366;&#2340; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404;</p>", "options_en": ["Rs.9800", "Rs.8400", "Rs.11200", "Rs.9600"], "options_hi": ["9800 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "8400 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "11200 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;", "9600 &#2352;&#2369;&#2346;&#2351;&#2375;"], "answer": 0, "solution_en": "<p>According to the question,</p><p><img width=175 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image008.png\"></p><p><img width=147 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image009.png\"></p><p><img width=175 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image010.png\"></p><p><img width=136 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=129 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image012.png\"></p><p><img width=85 height=17 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image013.png\"></p>", "solution_hi": "<p>According to the question,</p><p><img width=175 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image008.png\"></p><p><img width=147 height=44 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image009.png\"></p><p><img width=175 height=52 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image010.png\"></p><p><img width=136 height=36 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image011.png\"></p><p><img width=129 height=37 src=\"https://u1.oliveboard.in/exams/solution/oliveimg/p23231/image012.png\"></